{"unit_id":"tag:024O:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n如何使用这个定理？下面给出几点说明：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 假设<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes）之间的两个局部有限型（locally of finite type）态射（morphisms）。存在典范（canonical）短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0003>\n见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0001>。因此，这个定理表明，若<MATH_0004>无分歧（unramified），则<MATH_0005>亦然。这就是《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 由于<MATH_0006>同构（isomorphic）于对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）的余法（conormal）层（sheaf）（《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0003>），可知若<MATH_0007>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes）之间局部有限型（locally of finite type）的单态射（monomorphism），则<MATH_0008>无分歧（unramified）。\n特别地，局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes）的开（open）及闭浸入（closed immersions）均无分歧（unramified）。见《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0004>和<REF_0005>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 该定理还表明，一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>（它局部有限型（locally of finite type），且位于局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes）之间）不无分歧（unramified）的点（points）的集合（set），正是凝聚层（coherent sheaf）<MATH_0010>的支撑（support）。由此可给出“分歧轨迹（ramification locus）”的概形（scheme）意义下的定义。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"conormal","target_term":"余法"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"sour