{"unit_id":"tag:024Q:title","translation":"无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的函子性刻画（functorial characterization）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functorial characterization","target_term":"函子性刻画"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"待刻画的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"functorial characterization","target_term":"函子性刻画","context":"由态射函子的提升性质给出的刻画；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024Q:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在基础代数几何（algebraic geometry）中，我们学到某些态射（morphisms）类（classes）可以得到函子性刻画（characterized functorially），而这类描述颇为有用。无分歧（Unramified）态射（morphisms）也有这样的刻画（characterization）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"characterized functorially","target_term":"函子性刻画"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"characterization","target_term":"刻画"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何","context":"此处所述数学领域；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"被刻画的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类","context":"具有共同性质的态射类；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"characterized functorially","target_term":"函子性刻画","context":"按函子行为刻画的数学描述；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"句首的态射性质，保留大写；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"characterization","target_term":"刻画","context":"回指上述函子性数学刻画；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024R:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n假设<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme），且<MATH_0003>局部有限型（locally of finite type）。\n则下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>无分歧（unramified），\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>形式无分歧（formally unramified）：对任意仿射（affine）<MATH_0006>-概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>以及子概形（subscheme）<MATH_0008>，后者位于<MATH_0009>中且由平方为零的（square-zero）理想（ideal）定义，自然映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>\n是单射的（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式无分歧"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"subscheme","target_term":"子概形"},{"source_term":"square-zero","target_term":"平方为零的"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"给定态射的源与靶；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"基底概形的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底与仿射测试对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"给定态射的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两种性质的逻辑关系；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"第一条件的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式无分歧","context":"第二条件以唯一提升表述的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"测试对象的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"subscheme","target_term":"子概形","context":"测试对象中定义提升限制的子对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"square-zero","target_term":"平方为零的","context":"定义理想的幂零条件；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"定义测试子概形的数据；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"两个态射集合间的限制映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"提升的唯一性；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024R:proof","translation":"更一般的陈述与证明见《态射（Morphisms）进阶》中的引理<REF_0001>。下面给出当前情形的证明概要。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n首先可检查，这两个性质在源（source）与靶（target）上都是局部的（local）。因此可假设<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>均为仿射的（affine）。\n不妨写成<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>。\n再写成<MATH_0005>。设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>中平方为零的（square-zero）理想（ideal），且<MATH_0008>。假设给定图（diagram）\n<MATH_0009>\n其次可检查，对应（association）<MATH_0010>给出一个双射（bijection），一方是<MATH_0011>的提升（liftings）所成的集合（set），另一方是模（module）<MATH_0012>。因此，利用无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）具有平凡的（trivial）微分（differentials）模（module）这一描述，可得蕴含（implication）（1）<MATH_0013>（2），见定理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n为得到反向蕴含（implication），考虑满射（surjection）<MATH_0014>，它由平方为零的（square zero）理想（ideal）<MATH_0015>定义，其中<MATH_0016>是乘法映射（multiplication map）<MATH_0017>的核（kernel）。\n我们已有提升（lifting）<MATH_0018>，例如由<MATH_0019>定义。于是，由上述相同推理，可得<MATH_0020>的提升（liftings）与<MATH_0021>之间的双射（bijective）对应（correspondence）。因此，假设表明后一个模（module）是平凡的（trivial）。但我们知道<MATH_0022>。从而<MATH_0023>无分歧（unramified）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"square-zero","target_term":"平方为零的"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"association","target_term":"对应"},{"source_term":"bijection","target_term":"双射"},{"source_term":"liftings","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的"},{"source_term":"differentials","target_term":"微分"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"implication","target_term":"蕴含"},{"source_term":"implication","target_term":"蕴含"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"square zero","target_term":"平方为零的"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"multiplication map","target_term":"乘法映射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"lifting","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"liftings","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射"},{"source_term":"correspondence","target_term":"对应"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源","context":"给定态射的定义域；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶","context":"给定态射的目标；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的","context":"两种性质在源与靶上的局部性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"局部归约的情形；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"square-zero","target_term":"平方为零的","context":"第一段中子概形的定义理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"测试加厚的定义理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"给定的提升问题；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"association","target_term":"对应","context":"由两个提升之差定义的对应；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"bijection","target_term":"双射","context":"提升与导子之间的双射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"liftings","target_term":"提升","context":"对给定商映射的各个提升；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"所有提升构成的集合；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"导子模以及微分模；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"需要刻画的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"微分模判别适用的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的","context":"相关模为零的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"differentials","target_term":"微分","context":"无分歧性的微分判别；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"implication","target_term":"蕴含","context":"两个条件之间的正反逻辑方向；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"反向证明中构造的商映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"square zero","target_t