{"unit_id":"tag:024S:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n第一个对我们有用的拓扑（topological）结果断言，无分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）的态射（morphisms）具有“良好”的截面（sections）。本节内容不需要任何诺特（Noetherian）假设。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所述结果涉及的几何性质类别；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"给定态射的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"给定态射的另一性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"具有截面的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"态射的右逆，与下一句指本节的section不同；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"本节不要求的有限性条件；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024T:statement","translation":"无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的截面（Sections）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 无分歧（unramified）态射（morphism）的任意截面（section）都是开浸入（open immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 分离（separated）态射（morphism）的任意截面（section）都是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 无分歧（unramified）分离（separated）态射（morphism）的任意截面（section）都既开又闭（open and closed）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"open and closed","target_term":"既开又闭"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"态射性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"首句所讨论的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Sections","target_term":"截面","context":"首句的数学截面，保留大写；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"各项所讨论的单个映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"各项中的右逆；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"第一项的结论；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"保证截面闭性的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"第二项的结论；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"open and closed","target_term":"既开又闭","context":"第三项中截面同时开放与闭合的性质；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024T:proof","translation":"固定基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0001>。\n若<MATH_0002>是任意<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism），则图像（graph）\n<MATH_0004>\n由对角态射（diagonal）<MATH_0005>沿投影（projection）<MATH_0006>作基变换（base change）得到。\n若<MATH_0007>分离（separated）（分别地，无分歧（unramified）），则对角态射（diagonal）是闭浸入（closed immersion）（分别地，开浸入（open immersion）），由《概形（Schemes）》中的定义<REF_0001>（分别地，<SPACE_0001>《态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0002>）可知。\n因此，作为基变换（base change），图像（graph）也具有相同性质（由《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0003>）。\n特别地，在<MATH_0008>的情形，得到（1），分别地，<SPACE_0002>（2）。\n第（3）部分由（1）与（2）合并得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"graph","target_term":"图像"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"graph","target_term":"图像"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形","context":"共同基底；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基上的任意映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"graph","target_term":"图像","context":"态射的图像映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射","context":"经基变换得到图像的对角映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"所沿的积投影；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"图像与对角态射的关系；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"使对角闭合的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"使对角开放的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"分离情形的对角性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"无分歧情形的对角性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"}],"notes":["源文先列separated与unramified两个分支，最后写得到(1)、分别(2)，与陈述中的对应次序似有对调；保留原编号与全部保护token，不自行更正。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:024S:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在可以明确描述无分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的截面（sections）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"无分歧","context":"待描述的态射性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所研究的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"这些态射的右逆；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
